WEBVTT

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:18.001
[ SNIFFLES ]

00:00:28.272 --> 00:00:30.926
Harry: SALVIO HEXIA.

00:00:34.191 --> 00:00:36.845
REPELLUM MUGGLETUM.

00:00:39.674 --> 00:00:42.982
SALVIO HEXIA.

00:00:58.128 --> 00:01:00.478
[ RADIO TUNING]

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:07.093
♪ POOR, OLD JIM'S
WHITE AS A GHOST♪

00:01:07.137 --> 00:01:10.662
♪ HE'S FOUND THE ANSWER
THAT WE LOST♪

00:01:10.705 --> 00:01:14.274
♪ WE'RE ALL WEEPING NOW,
WEEPING BECAUSE♪

00:01:14.318 --> 00:01:20.411
♪ THERE AIN'T NOTHING WE CAN DO
TO PROTECT YOU♪

00:01:20.454 --> 00:01:25.068
♪ O CHILDREN♪

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.813
♪ LIFT UP YOUR VOICE♪

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:37.602
♪ LIFT UP YOUR VOICE♪

00:01:37.645 --> 00:01:39.995
♪ CHILDREN♪

00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:47.394
♪ REJOICE♪

00:01:47.438 --> 00:01:49.483
♪ REJOICE♪

00:01:49.527 --> 00:01:53.096
♪ HEY, LITTLE TRAIN,
WE'RE JUMPING ON♪

00:01:53.139 --> 00:01:57.143
♪ THE TRAIN THAT GOES
TO THE KINGDOM♪

00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:00.581
♪ WE'RE HAPPY, MA,
WE'RE HAVING FUN♪

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:04.890
♪ AND THE TRAIN AIN'T EVEN
LEFT THE STATION♪

00:02:04.933 --> 00:02:08.763
♪ HEY, LITTLE TRAIN,
WAIT FOR ME♪

00:02:08.807 --> 00:02:12.680
♪ I ONCE WAS BLIND,
BUT NOW I SEE♪

00:02:12.724 --> 00:02:16.031
♪ HAVE YOU LEFT A SEAT FOR ME?♪

00:02:16.075 --> 00:02:20.253
♪ IS THAT SUCH A STRETCH
OF THE IMAGINATION?♪

00:02:20.297 --> 00:02:23.952
♪ HEY, LITTLE TRAIN,
WAIT FOR ME♪

00:02:23.996 --> 00:02:27.826
♪ I WAS HELD IN CHAINS,
BUT NOW I'M FREE♪

00:02:27.869 --> 00:02:31.090
♪ I'M HANGING IN THERE,
DON'T YOU SEE♪

00:02:31.134 --> 00:02:35.703
♪ IN THIS PROCESS
OF ELIMINATION♪

00:02:35.747 --> 00:02:39.054
♪ HEY, LITTLE TRAIN,
WE'RE JUMPING ON♪

00:02:39.098 --> 00:02:42.754
♪ THE TRAIN THAT GOES
TO THE KINGDOM♪

00:02:42.797 --> 00:02:46.671
♪ WE'RE HAPPY, MA,
WE'RE A-HAVING FUN♪

00:02:46.714 --> 00:02:51.197
♪ IT'S BEYOND
MY WILDEST EXPECTATION♪

00:02:51.241 --> 00:02:54.244
♪ HEY, LITTLE TRAIN,
WE'RE JUMPING ON♪

00:02:54.287 --> 00:02:58.030
♪ THE TRAIN THAT GOES
TO THE KINGDOM♪

00:02:58.073 --> 00:03:01.512
♪ WE'RE HAPPY, MA,
WE'RE HAVING FUN♪

00:03:01.555 --> 00:03:06.647
♪ AND THE TRAIN AIN'T EVEN
LEFT THE STATION♪

00:03:17.745 --> 00:03:19.921
[ BIRDS CHIRPING ]

00:03:52.867 --> 00:03:54.913
HERMIONE?

00:03:54.956 --> 00:03:57.394
Harry: HERMIONE?
YOU WERE RIGHT.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.265
SNITCHES HAVE
FLESH MEMORIES,

00:03:59.309 --> 00:04:02.137
BUT I DIDN'T CATCH
THE FIRST SNITCH WITH MY HAND.

00:04:02.181 --> 00:04:03.487
I ALMOST SWALLOWED IT.

00:04:08.709 --> 00:04:10.711
"I OPEN AT THE CLOSE."

00:04:10.755 --> 00:04:12.060
YEAH.
WHAT DO YOU THINK THAT MEANS?

00:04:12.104 --> 00:04:13.497
I DON'T KNOW.

00:04:15.673 --> 00:04:18.719
I FOUND SOMETHING
AS WELL.

00:04:24.508 --> 00:04:26.423
AT FIRST, I THOUGHT
IT WAS AN EYE,

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:28.163
BUT NOW I DON'T THINK
IT IS.

00:04:28.207 --> 00:04:29.600
IT ISN'T A RUNE.

00:04:29.643 --> 00:04:32.516
AND IT ISN'T ANYWHERE
IN SPELLMAN'S SYLLABARY.

00:04:32.559 --> 00:04:34.039
SOMEBODY INKED IT IN.

00:04:34.082 --> 00:04:36.563
IT ISN'T PART OF THE BOOK.
SOMEBODY DREW IT.

00:04:36.607 --> 00:04:39.914
LUNA'S DAD WAS WEARING THAT
AT BILL AND FLEUR'S WEDDING.

00:04:42.395 --> 00:04:45.746
WHY WOULD SOMEONE DRAW IT
IN A CHILDREN'S BOOK?

00:04:48.183 --> 00:04:51.317
LOOK, HERMIONE,
I'VE BEEN THINKING.

00:04:51.361 --> 00:04:53.885
I WANT TO GO
TO GODRIC'S HOLLOW.

00:04:53.928 --> 00:04:56.583
YOU KNOW, IT'S WHERE I WAS BORN.
IT'S WHERE MY PARENTS DIED.

00:04:56.627 --> 00:04:58.803
[ SIGHS ] THAT'S EXACTLY WHERE
HE'LL EXPECT YOU TO GO

00:04:58.846 --> 00:05:00.326
BECAUSE IT MEANS
SOMETHING TO YOU.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:03.329
UH, YEAH, BUT IT MEANS SOMETHING
TO HIM, TOO, HERMIONE.

00:05:03.373 --> 00:05:05.200
YOU-KNOW-WHO
ALMOST DIED THERE.

00:05:05.244 --> 00:05:07.551
I MEAN, ISN'T THAT
EXACTLY THE TYPE OF PLACE

00:05:07.594 --> 00:05:09.857
HE'D BE LIKELY TO HIDE
A HORCRUX?

00:05:09.901 --> 00:05:13.252
[ SIGHS ] THAT'S --
IT'S DANGEROUS, HARRY.

00:05:13.296 --> 00:05:15.080
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:15.123 --> 00:05:16.647
BUT EVEN I HAVE TO ADMIT,

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:19.432
RECENTLY I'VE BEEN THINKING
WE'LL HAVE TO GO THERE.

00:05:19.476 --> 00:05:22.174
I THINK IT'S POSSIBLE
SOMETHING ELSE IS HIDDEN THERE.

00:05:22.217 --> 00:05:24.045
WHAT?

00:05:24.089 --> 00:05:26.265
THE SWORD.

00:05:26.309 --> 00:05:28.049
IF DUMBLEDORE
WANTED YOU TO FIND IT

00:05:28.093 --> 00:05:30.530
BUT DIDN'T WANT IT FALLING
INTO THE MINISTRY'S HANDS,

00:05:30.574 --> 00:05:32.184
WHERE BETTER TO HIDE IT

00:05:32.227 --> 00:05:35.535
THAN THE BIRTHPLACE
OF THE FOUNDER OF GRYFFINDOR?

00:05:35.579 --> 00:05:38.712
H-HERMIONE...

00:05:42.716 --> 00:05:45.980
DON'T EVER LET ME GIVE YOU
A HAIRCUT AGAIN.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.775
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:05:57.818 --> 00:06:00.734
[ DOG BARKING ]

00:06:07.001 --> 00:06:09.874
I STILL THINK WE SHOULD HAVE
USED POLYJUICE POTION.

00:06:09.917 --> 00:06:11.919
NO.

00:06:11.963 --> 00:06:14.661
THIS IS WHERE I WAS BORN.

00:06:14.705 --> 00:06:18.404
I'M NOT RETURNING
AS SOMEONE ELSE.

00:06:18.448 --> 00:06:20.798
[ BELL TOLLS ]

00:06:26.978 --> 00:06:29.937
Man: GOOD NIGHT!
[ LAUGHS ]

00:06:29.981 --> 00:06:32.766
[ CHOIR SINGING ]

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:36.727
HARRY,
I THINK IT'S CHRISTMAS EVE.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:39.207
LISTEN.

00:06:39.251 --> 00:06:41.862
[ SINGING CONTINUES ]

00:06:43.211 --> 00:06:47.564
DO YOU THINK THEY'D BE IN THERE,
HERMIONE?

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:49.740
MY MUM AND DAD?

00:06:55.223 --> 00:06:57.661
YEAH,
I THINK THEY WOULD.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:03.057
[ FOOTSTEPS ]

